{"path":"container/stack/operator=","title":"std::stack<T,Container>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::stack&lt;T,Container&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/stack/operator=","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Replaces the contents of the container adaptor with the contents of given argument.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx98\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stack<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> stack<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark\">(implicitly declared)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stack<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> stack<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(implicitly declared)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Replaces the contents of the container adaptor with the contents of given argument.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Copy assignment operator. Replaces the contents with a copy of the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>. Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> other.<span class=\"me1\">c</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Move assignment operator. Replaces the contents with those of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> using move semantics. Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>other.<span class=\"me1\">c</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another container adaptor to be used as source\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> Equivalent to that of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span></span></code> of the underlying\ncontainer.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack/stack\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs the <code>stack</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/stack","title":"std::stack"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::stack<T,Container>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++98, since C++11. Replaces the contents of the container adaptor with the contents of given argument."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Equivalent to that of operator= of the underlying container."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs the stack"}]}]},"standards":["C++98","C++11"],"wordCount":112,"codeBlockCount":0}
